WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.096
Which offer is really better?

00:00:05.096 --> 00:00:06.975
And who do you know there?

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.775
Your job hunt shouldn't be a full-time job.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.856
The Comps tab puts your live opportunities side by side,

00:00:16.856 --> 00:00:19.075
with a suggestion and the reasons.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:22.935
Pay, fit, stage and the people you know.

00:00:22.935 --> 00:00:25.540
The best value in a row gets a star.

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:31.765
Your own LinkedIn data shows who you know at each company, closest first.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:35.807
Set your pay target and floor in Settings.

00:00:35.807 --> 00:00:37.715
They stay on this computer.
